  "source_issues": [
    "Source SNP genetic positions use AF_TYPE float32 before CRF spacing arithmetic; the first binary64 native comparison failed four cases and remains retained. Corrected comparator changes no input/output/threshold.",
    "SIS header has reference/internal-simulation columns absent from numeric rows; iteration streams are not closed. All raw bytes/rows retained, final-iteration probabilities unqualified.",
    "Q fractions weight CRF markers equally; the three-population case distinguishes this from equal-SNP weighting.",
    "Original valued long options require --name=value; first three separated-value invocations exited by SIGSEGV before input loading and remain unadmitted.",
    "Five SDK setup attempts failed before scientific compilation; source/configuration logs retained; successful build used private original prerequisites and auxiliary files without autoupdate or scientific source patches."
